      "type": "label",
      "text": "How to use: tap the gear button at the top of the screen, next to the pause button, while playing to open the in-game editor."
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "Position tab: move the armor display (whole group) and the arrow, potion, totem and used-slots counters with the X and Y sliders."
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "Settings tab: turn the right-hand display and each counter ON/OFF, pick the durability display mode, and show or hide the counter slot background."
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "Armor piece icons, left hand, slot background, durability display mode and armor layout are global settings - they are changed on this screen, not in the in-game editor."
